            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Sakura",
            "review_text": "David H\nDymchurch, United Kingdom164 contributions\n0\nThe menu does not reflect what is available\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nI ordered bia Saigon, which was only VND10,000, and some deep fried prawns. The prawns were very nice, but I thought a bit pricey. \nWhen they arrived, I ordered some Russian dumplings. A few minutes later, the waiter returned telling me that they didn't have any. I then ordered a tuna salad. A few minutes passed and the same thing happened again! I said to the waiter, \"What do you have?\" He responded by pointing at 1 double page of 1 of 2 menus. Nothing on this page appealed to either myself or my wife, so I paid the bill and we left.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2019",
